4. **Atrial natriu-etic perception (ANP):** When the at least of the heart are stretched due to high pressure, they release this hormone, which increases the excretion of sodium and water by the kidneys, reducing volume and pressure.  
5. **Relying of the renal-angle system:** This system is activated to reduce volume and pressure.  
