- PbO(s): 66.5 J/K mol
- SO\(_2\)(g): 248.2 J/K mol

Now, we can calculate the entropy change:

ΔS = (2 * S(PbO) + 2 * S(SO\(_2\))) - (2 * S(PbS) + 3 * S(O\(_2\)))

