ΔS = ΣS_products - ΣS_reactants

For the given reaction:

\[ 2 \text{PbS(s)} + 3 \text{O}_2(g) \rightarrow 2 \text{PbO(s)} + 2 \text{SO}_2(g) \]

The molar entropies are:

- PbS(s): 91.2 J/K mol
- O\(_2\)(g): 205.1 J/K mol
- PbO(s): 66.5 J/K mol
- SO\(_2\)(g): 248.2 J/K mol

