- \( \text{MnS} \): \( K_{sp} = 2.3 \times 10^{-16} \) (slightly insoluble)
- \( \text{NiS} \): \( \text{No data (soluble)} \).

The correct answer is:
1. \( \text{HgS} \) precipitates (most insoluble).
2. \( \text{CuS} \) precipitates (insoluble).
3. \( \text{MnS} \) precipitates (slightly insoluble).
4. \( \text{NiS} \) does not precipitate (soluble).

