2. **Key Features of the $D_2$-Sheet:** The $D_2$ symmetry of the **cis-cis-cis** arrangement in the **boat** conformation is essential for the formation of the **cyclic twistane** structure. This symmetry arises from the **C₂ axis perpendicular to the plane of the ring** and **two C₂ axes** along the **opposite sides of the ring**.

