When dissolved in water, the complex ion `[Pt(NH3)4Cl2]^2+` dissociates into `[Pt(NH3)4Cl2]^2+` and two chloride ions (`2Cl^-`).

Thus, the dissociation equation is:
\[
[Pt(NH_3)_4Cl_2]Cl_2 \rightarrow [Pt(NH_3)_4Cl_2]^{2+} + 2Cl^-
\]

