   moles of naphthalene = 0.5126 g / 128.17 g/mol ≈ 0.004 mol

   Now, find the molality of the naphthalene solution:
   m = moles of solute / kilograms of solvent
   m = 0.004 mol / 0.050 kg ≈ 0.08 mol/kg

