1. The given strand has:
   - 20 A
   - 25 G
   - 30 C
   - 22 T

2. The complementary strand will have:
   - 20 T (to pair with the 20 A)
   - 25 C (to pair with the 25 G)
   - 30 G (to pair with the 30 C)
   - 22 A (to with the 22 T)

