   - Total A: 20 (original) + 22 (complemently) = 42
   - Total G: 25 (original) + 30 (complemently) = 55
   - Total C: 30 (original) + 25 (complementay) = 55
   - Total T: 22 (original) + 20 (complementay) = 42

